== Link
The link notation uses `[]` or `[""]`.

링크는 `[]` 또는 `[""]`를 사용합니다.

[[[#!WikiSyntaxPreview
 * Url
  1. http://aha00a.com
  1. [http://aha00a.com]
  1. [http://aha00a.com aha00a.com Alias]
 * Page
  1. [Page1]
  1. [Page1 Alias For Page1]
 * Page with space
  1. ["United States"]
  1. ["United States" United States of America]
 * Anchor
  1. [#Anchor]
  1. [#Anchor Anchor Alias]
 * QueryString
  1. [?q=10]
  1. [?q=10 q10 Alias]
]]]

use `\` for escaping
링크 문법 무효화를 하기 위해서는 `\`를 사용합니다.

[[[#!WikiSyntaxPreview
 * Url
  1. \http://aha00a.com
  1. \[http://aha00a.com]
  1. \[http://aha00a.com aha00a.com Alias]
 * Page
  1. \[Page1]
  1. \[Page1 Alias For Page1]
 * Page with space
  1. \["United States"]
  1. \["United States" United States of America]
 * Anchor
  1. \[#Anchor]
  1. \[#Anchor Anchor Alias]
 * QueryString
  1. \[?q=10]
  1. \[?q=10 q10 Alias]
]]]




























